# The Showcase (v0.0.14): one scene, an area per engine feature. Visits
# each area and checks that what it shows is running.
expect_level showcase
expect_near 0 0.25 12.5 0.3
# The plaza: animated models.
expect_animating cube_2
# The pavilion: the character's state machine walks it through its loop
# (stand 0-2 s, then speed up): by now it moves.
wait 4
teleport -15 0.25 7 -90
expect_state rudy move
# The lakeshore: water and its planar reflection are drawn.
teleport 0 0.5 -17 0
wait 0.5
expect_water 1
expect_reflection 1
# Weather applies to the whole scene: rain falls (particles), then night.
environment rain 0
wait 1
expect_environment rain
expect_particles > 100
environment night 1
wait 1.5
expect_environment night
# The light corner, at night.
teleport 14 0.25 6 90
wait 0.5
environment clear_day 0
# The toon garden and the synth booth.
teleport -26 0.25 -2 0
wait 0.3
teleport 26 0.25 -2 0
wait 0.3
expect_voices_max 0
log showcase tour done
